An aluminum ion has a charge of +3, and an oxide ion has a charge of -2. Which would be the product of a reaction between these two elements?
A) 2AlO_{3}
B) Al_{2}O_{3}
C) Al_{3}O_{2}
D) Al_{2}O
Print only a single choice  from "A" or "B" or "C" or "D" without explanation.
Answer:

Please answer with the letter of the correct answer.

